<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ZURO.lag — R6</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --void:       #08080c;
    --panel:      #0f0f16;
    --panel-2:    #14141d;
    --line:       #241019;
    --line-soft:  #1a1420;
    --pink:       #ff2f6e;
    --pink-dim:   #ff2f6e26;
    --pink-glow:  #ff2f6e55;
    --text:       #e7e6ee;
    --text-dim:   #7a7788;
    --text-faint: #4c495a;
    --mono: "IBM Plex Mono","SFMono-Regular",Consolas,"Liberation Mono",Menlo,monospace;
  }

  *{ box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }

  html{ background:var(--void); }

  body{
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 900px 500px at 15% -10%, #1a0812 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 700px 500px at 100% 20%, #12060e 0%, transparent 55%),
      var(--void);
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:var(--mono);
    line-height:1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    min-height:100vh;
  }

  /* faint scanline texture */
  body::before{
    content:"";
    position:fixed; inset:0;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(
      to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.012) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.012) 1px,
      transparent 1px, transparent 3px
    );
    pointer-events:none;
    z-index:1;
  }

  a{ color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }

  .eyebrow{
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.16em;
    color:var(--pink);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content:"";
    width:6px; height:6px;
    background:var(--pink);
    box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--pink-glow);
  }

  /* ---------- top chrome bar ---------- */
  .chrome{
    max-width:920px;
    margin:36px auto 0;
    padding:0 24px;
  }
  .chrome-bar{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom:2px solid var(--pink);
    background:var(--panel);
    padding:14px 20px;
  }
  .chrome-left{ display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:10px; }
  .chrome-left .z{
    color:var(--pink);
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.06em;
    font-size:15px;
  }
  .chrome-left .r6{
    color:var(--text-dim);
    font-size:13px;
  }
  .chrome-right{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; font-size:12px; color:var(--text-faint); }
  .status-pill{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--panel-2);
    color:var(--text-dim);
    padding:3px 12px;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    font-size:11px;
  }

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    max-width:920px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:70px 24px 40px;
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,46px);
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    color:var(--text);
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .hero h1 .accent{ color:var(--pink); text-shadow:0 0 22px var(--pink-glow); }
  .hero p{
    max-width:520px;
    color:var(--text-dim);
    font-size:14.5px;
    margin-bottom:32px;
  }
  .hero-ctas{ display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; }

  .btn-primary{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, #2a0a16, #1c0710);
    border:1px solid var(--pink);
    color:var(--pink);
    padding:14px 26px;
    font-family:var(--mono);
    font-size:13px;
    letter-spacing:.12em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:all .15s ease;
    box-shadow:0 0 0px var(--pink-glow);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{
    background:var(--pink);
    color:#0a0510;
    box-shadow:0 0 26px var(--pink-glow);
  }
  .btn-secondary{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    color:var(--text-dim);
    padding:14px 20px;
    font-size:12.5px;
    letter-spacing:.06em;
    transition:all .15s ease;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover{ border-color:var(--text-dim); color:var(--text); }

  .meta-row{
    margin-top:22px;
    display:flex;
    gap:22px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    font-size:11.5px;
    color:var(--text-faint);
  }
  .meta-row span b{ color:var(--text-dim); font-weight:500; }

  /* ---------- app preview mock ---------- */
  .preview{
    max-width:920px;
    margin:10px auto 90px;
    padding:0 24px;
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
  }
  .app-window{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--panel);
    box-shadow:0 40px 90px -30px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
  }
  .app-titlebar{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    padding:12px 18px;
    border-bottom:2px solid var(--pink);
  }
  .app-titlebar .title{ color:var(--pink); font-weight:700; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.04em; }
  .app-titlebar .title span{ color:var(--text-dim); font-weight:400; }
  .app-titlebar .win-right{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; font-size:11px; color:var(--text-faint); }
  .idle-pill{ border:1px solid var(--line); padding:2px 10px; color:var(--text-dim); letter-spacing:.08em; }
  .app-tabs{
    display:flex;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:11.5px;
  }
  .app-tabs div{
    padding:10px 20px;
    color:var(--text-faint);
    letter-spacing:.04em;
  }
  .app-tabs div.active{
    color:var(--pink);
    border-bottom:2px solid var(--pink);
    margin-bottom:-1px;
  }
  .app-body{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:0;
  }
  .app-col{ padding:20px 22px; border-right:1px solid var(--line-soft); }
  .app-col:last-child{ border-right:none; }
  .panel-label{
    font-size:10.5px;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    color:var(--pink);
    margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .field-row{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom:12px;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .field-row .val{
    background:var(--panel-2);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    color:var(--text-faint);
    padding:5px 10px;
    min-width:120px;
    text-align:left;
    font-size:11.5px;
  }
  .check-row{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .check-row .box{
    width:14px; height:14px;
    border:1px solid var(--pink);
    background:var(--pink-dim);
    color:var(--pink);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-size:10px;
  }
  .app-footer-cta{
    grid-column:1 / -1;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:16px 22px;
  }
  .activate-bar{
    border:1px solid var(--pink);
    background:var(--pink-dim);
    color:var(--pink);
    text-align:center;
    padding:12px;
    font-size:12px;
    letter-spacing:.16em;
  }

  /* ---------- sections ---------- */
  .section{
    max-width:920px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:20px 24px 80px;
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
  }
  .section h2{
    font-size:20px;
    color:var(--text);
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .section .sub{ color:var(--text-dim); font-size:13px; margin-bottom:34px; max-width:520px; }

  .grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap:1px;
    background:var(--line);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .card{
    background:var(--panel);
    padding:22px 20px;
  }
  .card .tag{
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    color:var(--pink);
    margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  .card h3{ font-size:14px; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:8px; font-weight:600; }
  .card p{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-dim); }

  /* ---------- download panel ---------- */
  .download-panel{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--panel);
    padding:36px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:30px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .download-panel .left h3{ font-size:17px; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:8px; }
  .download-panel .left p{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-dim); max-width:420px; }
  .dl-specs{
    display:flex;
    gap:26px;
    margin-top:16px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .dl-specs div{ font-size:11px; color:var(--text-faint); }
  .dl-specs div b{ display:block; color:var(--text-dim); font-size:12.5px; margin-bottom:2px; }

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  footer{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:24px;
  }
  .footer-inner{
    max-width:920px;
    margin:0 auto;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    font-size:11.5px;
    color:var(--text-faint);
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .footer-inner b{ color:var(--text-dim); font-weight:500; }
  .footer-links{ display:flex; gap:18px; }
  .footer-links a{ color:var(--text-faint); transition:color .15s; }
  .footer-links a:hover{ color:var(--pink); }

  @media (max-width:720px){
    .app-body{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .app-col{ border-right:none; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft); }
    .grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    .download-panel{ flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="chrome">
    <div class="chrome-bar">
      <div class="chrome-left">
        <span class="z">ZURO</span><span class="r6">.lag -R6</span>
      </div>
      <div class="chrome-right">
        <span class="status-pill">IDLE</span>
        <span>C++ / Windows</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Release R6</div>
    <h1>Take control of your <span class="accent">connection</span>,<br>on your terms.</h1>
    <p>ZURO.lag is a lightweight network-control utility with keybind activation,
       configurable duration windows, and a live status HUD. Built in C++, no bloat.</p>

    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="#download">↓ Download latest — R6</a>
      <a class="btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View source on GitHub</a>
    </div>

    <div class="meta-row">
      <span><b>Version</b> R6</span>
      <span><b>Platform</b> Windows 10/11</span>
      <span><b>Language</b> C++</span>
      <span><b>License</b> Open source</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="preview">
    <div class="app-window">
      <div class="app-titlebar">
        <div class="title">ZURO <span>.lag -R6</span></div>
        <div class="win-right">
          <span>0.0s</span>
          <span class="idle-pill">IDLE</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="app-tabs">
        <div class="active">Main</div>
        <div>Network</div>
        <div>Logs</div>
        <div>Settings</div>
      </div>
      <div class="app-body">
        <div class="app-col">
          <div class="panel-label">ACTIVATION</div>
          <div class="field-row"><span>Keyboard Key</span><span class="val">&nbsp;</span></div>
          <div class="field-row"><span>Mouse Button</span><span class="val">XBUTTON1</span></div>
          <div class="panel-label" style="margin-top:22px;">CONTROL</div>
          <div class="field-row"><span>Lag Mode</span><span class="val">Lag Switch</span></div>
          <div class="check-row"><span class="box">✓</span> Hold Key Mode</div>
          <div class="check-row"><span class="box">✓</span> Sounds</div>
        </div>
        <div class="app-col">
          <div class="panel-label">NETWORK</div>
          <div class="field-row"><span>Traffic</span><span class="val">Outgoing</span></div>
          <div class="field-row"><span>Duration (ms)</span><span class="val">2000</span></div>
          <div class="field-row"><span>Delay After (ms)</span><span class="val">100</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="app-footer-cta">
          <div class="activate-bar">ACTIVATE</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Feature set</div>
    <h2>Everything configurable, nothing hidden.</h2>
    <p class="sub">Every panel in the app maps directly to a setting you can script, save, or bind to a key.</p>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="tag">01 — BIND</div>
        <h3>Keyboard &amp; mouse capture</h3>
        <p>Assign activation to any key or mouse button with a single click-to-capture flow.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="tag">02 — MODE</div>
        <h3>Hold or toggle</h3>
        <p>Switch between hold-to-activate and toggle modes depending on how you work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="tag">03 — TRAFFIC</div>
        <h3>Outgoing / incoming control</h3>
        <p>Target outgoing or incoming traffic independently, with an optional TCP-only mode.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="tag">04 — TIMING</div>
        <h3>Duration &amp; delay windows</h3>
        <p>Set precise millisecond windows for how long a control window runs and the delay after.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="tag">05 — SAFETY</div>
        <h3>Force stop</h3>
        <p>One-click kill switch instantly restores normal connection behavior.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="tag">06 — FEEDBACK</div>
        <h3>Live status HUD</h3>
        <p>Elapsed time, current state, and method are always visible in the title bar.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section" id="download">
    <div class="eyebrow">Get it</div>
    <h2>Download ZURO.lag</h2>
    <p class="sub">Grab the latest build straight from the GitHub release page.</p>

    <div class="download-panel">
      <div class="left">
        <h3>zuro.lag-R6.zip</h3>
        <p>Windows build, packaged with the compiled binary and default config.</p>
        <div class="dl-specs">
          <div><b>R6</b>Version</div>
          <div><b>~2.4 MB</b>Size</div>
          <div><b>Win10/11</b>Requires</div>
          <div><b>C++</b>Built with</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="btn-primary" href="https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/YOUR-REPO/releases/latest" target="_blank" rel="noopener">↓ Download R6</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div><b>zuro.lag -R6</b> · C++ &nbsp;|&nbsp; Administrator build</div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        <a href="#download">Releases</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/YOUR-REPO/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Issues</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
